    fields:  # d543
      statement: "The Swift/Vapor route extractor (swift.py:1104+) matches only bare app/routes/router receivers and misses the RouteCollection grouped(...).verb(use:) and .on(...) grouped-builder chain, so ~236 endpoints go undetected despite vapor detected (VernissageServer EXPECTED_ROUTES_BUT_FOUND_0)."  # d543
      root_cause: "The Vapor route extractor only recognizes bare app/routes/router receivers and does not walk the grouped-builder chain (grouped(...).verb(use:), .on(...)) that Vapor apps use for nested route groups."  # d543
